348
11:57.717 --> 11:58.238
You are here.

349
11:59.317 --> 12:00.398
I fixed the water pipe.

350
12:00.638 --> 12:01.118
Almost

351
12:01.317 --> 12:02.557
dropped this down the drain.

352
12:03.158 --> 12:03.837
You could've

353
12:03.917 --> 12:04.758
called a handyman

354
12:04.758 --> 12:05.797
or asked me for this.

355
12:06.437 --> 12:07.837
A kid

356
12:08.758 --> 12:09.437
doesn't know how.

357
12:09.917 --> 12:11.557
We overseas students know everything.

358
12:11.797 --> 12:12.957
And stop seeing me

359
12:12.957 --> 12:13.518
as a kid.

360
12:14.437 --> 12:14.957
Right, Meng,

361
12:15.437 --> 12:16.398
can I talk to you

362
12:16.478 --> 12:17.358
in private?

363
12:21.358 --> 12:22.077
What's up, Harry?

364
12:22.717 --> 12:23.557
What is it?

365
12:24.717 --> 12:25.118
Meng,

366
12:25.677 --> 12:26.238
I overheard

367
12:26.238 --> 12:27.118
what Jiao Xu said.

368
12:27.717 --> 12:29.077
Someone embezzled Jiali's funds.

369
12:29.957 --> 12:30.597
I want to know

370
12:31.197 --> 12:32.197
how much money that was.

371
12:32.557 --> 12:33.917
It has nothing to do with you.

372
12:34.197 --> 12:34.957
Besides,

373
12:35.717 --> 12:36.957
you shouldn't talk about it.

374
12:37.638 --> 12:38.278
Meng,

375
12:38.837 --> 12:39.717
don't see me as a kid.

376
12:39.758 --> 12:40.557
I'm a grown man.

377
12:41.398 --> 12:41.878
If

378
12:42.638 --> 12:43.677
I pay back the money

379
12:43.717 --> 12:44.398
with interest,

380
12:45.238 --> 12:46.238
can you spare my parents?

381
12:46.837 --> 12:48.238
If you want to be seen as an adult,

382
12:48.917 --> 12:50.038
stop running away from home

383
12:50.077 --> 12:50.797
like kids.

384
12:52.518 --> 12:52.837
But...

385
12:53.278 --> 12:54.677
Your mom already came to me.

386
12:55.038 --> 12:56.557
You can't crash on the sofa forever.

387
12:56.837 --> 12:57.638
Once you cool off,

388
12:57.837 --> 12:58.677
go back home.

389
13:09.758 --> 13:10.317
Here, Mr. Liu.

390
13:10.717 --> 13:11.197
Cheers.

391
13:17.518 --> 13:18.158
Ms. Yu,

392
13:18.478 --> 13:19.957
Jiali's current situation

393
13:20.557 --> 13:21.478
is really hard

394
13:21.597 --> 13:22.197
to read.

395
13:22.317 --> 13:23.758
Jiali's development

396
13:24.077 --> 13:25.758
is definitely stable and positive.

397
13:27.118 --> 13:27.478
Mr. Liu,

398
13:28.797 --> 13:29.957
you're well aware

399
13:30.358 --> 13:31.478
of our technical barriers

400
13:31.878 --> 13:32.837
and market roadmap.

401
13:33.317 --> 13:34.758
All we need now

402
13:34.837 --> 13:35.797
is some investment.

403
13:36.478 --> 13:37.797
Once funding is in place...

404
13:38.758 --> 13:40.158
Anyone can make empty promises.

405
13:40.917 --> 13:41.717
What I want

406
13:42.038 --> 13:42.917
is actually simple.

407
13:43.478 --> 13:44.478
Overhaul the core team,

408
13:45.437 --> 13:46.518
halve the product lines.

409
13:47.038 --> 13:48.797
Plus an authorization condition.

410
13:49.238 --> 13:50.597
If in six months,

411
13:50.837 --> 13:51.638
the value of company

412
13:51.677 --> 13:52.677
can't grow by 30 percent,

413
13:52.677 --> 13:53.878
I will force an exit.

414
13:55.917 --> 13:57.158
So you mean

415
13:57.638 --> 13:58.717
you want to invest low

416
13:59.597 --> 14:00.358
and flip it high?

417
14:00.917 --> 14:02.077
If the company is doomed,

418
14:03.038 --> 14:04.797
at least I can safely

419
14:04.837 --> 14:05.998
recover my principal.

420
14:06.158 --> 14:07.118
Mr. Liu, listen.

421
14:07.437 --> 14:08.278
We can

422
14:08.597 --> 14:09.518
agree on other terms,

423
14:09.797 --> 14:10.518
but on this point,

424
14:11.118 --> 14:12.278
we really can't accept.

425
14:15.518 --> 14:17.358
Given Jiali's current financial situation,

426
14:18.478 --> 14:19.358
except me,

427
14:19.837 --> 14:20.677
hardly anyone dares

428
14:20.717 --> 14:21.957
touch this mess.

429
14:27.878 --> 14:28.677
Think it over.

430
14:29.638 --> 14:30.437
Let's call it a day.

431
14:31.238 --> 14:32.638
It's only a temporary crisis.

432
14:33.358 --> 14:33.998
Five years ago,

433
14:34.557 --> 14:35.677
Jiali's market share

434
14:36.158 --> 14:36.998
was lower than now.

435
14:38.437 --> 14:39.878
But we still made through.

436
14:42.998 --> 14:43.317
Hello,

437
14:44.077 --> 14:44.677
Mr. Liu.

438
14:46.557 --> 14:47.998
I'm the chairman of Jiali Cosmetics,

439
14:48.278 --> 14:48.758
Di Liren.

440
14:50.197 --> 14:50.717
Mr. Di,

441
14:51.118 --> 14:51.837
nice to meet you.

442
14:53.437 --> 14:54.717
However, I notice something

443
14:55.317 --> 14:56.677
in what you just said.

444
14:58.398 --> 15:00.238
You took over your own family company,

445
15:00.398 --> 15:01.597
so you should put everything

446
15:02.038 --> 15:02.837
into it.

447
15:03.238 --> 15:05.038
But I'm putting up my own money

448
15:05.437 --> 15:06.518
to save your company.

449
15:07.238 --> 15:08.437
And I'm taking a gamble

450
15:09.077 --> 15:10.158
on whether you and Ms. Yu

451
15:10.717 --> 15:12.437
can bring Jiali back from the dead.

452
15:18.197 --> 15:18.557
Wine.

453
15:18.557 --> 15:19.278
Give it to me.

454
15:24.238 --> 15:24.957
Since you've

455
15:25.118 --> 15:26.317
put it so clearly, Mr. Liu,

456
15:26.677 --> 15:28.197
we will definitely

457
15:28.238 --> 15:29.238
give it our all.

458
15:32.557 --> 15:33.557
But, Mr. Liu,

459
15:34.557 --> 15:35.238
give us some room

460
15:35.317 --> 15:36.158
to maneuver.

461
15:37.038 --> 15:38.197
That'll keep us motivated,

462
15:38.518 --> 15:39.998
and your effort won't be in vain.

463
15:40.278 --> 15:41.317
After all, what we want

464
15:41.717 --> 15:42.478
is a win-win.

465
15:45.758 --> 15:46.437
Don't you agree,

466
15:47.597 --> 15:48.038
Mr. Liu?

467
16:00.118 --> 16:01.638
Since we can't see eye to eye,

468
16:02.597 --> 16:04.038
maybe we can work together one day.

469
16:07.278 --> 16:07.758
Excuse me.

470
16:15.642 --> 16:19.197
(Wu Ta)

471
16:19.197 --> 16:20.002
Di Liren and Mr. Liu

472
16:20.002 --> 16:20.638
are connected.

473
16:21.197 --> 16:22.197
No wonder

474
16:22.197 --> 16:23.478
he showed up that day.

475
16:23.758 --> 16:24.957
I knew he was up to no good.

476
16:25.717 --> 16:26.597
He even tried to

477
16:26.878 --> 16:27.957
bait me into selling

478
16:28.158 --> 16:29.077
my shares to Mr. Liu.

479
16:30.197 --> 16:31.358
Then when we divorce,

480
16:31.597 --> 16:32.717
he could take half.

481
16:33.077 --> 16:34.278
By then, his shares

482
16:34.638 --> 16:35.398
would exceed mine.

483
16:35.878 --> 16:36.398
So,

484
16:37.118 --> 16:38.317
you'd work with Han Guang?

485
16:40.478 --> 16:41.358
At least I know

486
16:41.758 --> 16:43.158
what Han Guang wants right now.

487
16:43.638 --> 16:44.398
I knew

488
16:44.437 --> 16:45.717
we'd have a talk,

489
16:46.038 --> 16:46.717
but unexpectedly,

490
16:46.957 --> 16:47.957
you came to me yourself.

491
16:49.158 --> 16:50.238
Isn't this what you've

492
16:50.518 --> 16:51.398
always wanted?

493
16:52.238 --> 16:53.437
There are no eternal enemies,

494
16:53.797 --> 16:54.957
only eternal interests.

495
16:56.557 --> 16:57.797
You see the bigger picture.

496
16:58.478 --> 16:59.557
Name your terms.

497
16:59.717 --> 17:01.518
I've always been direct in business.

498
17:02.518 --> 17:03.278
As long as

499
17:03.677 --> 17:04.548
it's a nice offer.

500
17:05.278 --> 17:05.718
I hold

501
17:05.758 --> 17:06.998
45 percent of Jiali's shares.

502
17:07.958 --> 17:09.357
I can sell you ten percent

503
17:09.758 --> 17:10.918
as a private transaction.

504
17:11.678 --> 17:12.758
However, on two conditions.

505
17:13.278 --> 17:13.637
First,

506
17:14.077 --> 17:15.758
you stop the sales of Jingyue.

507
17:16.438 --> 17:16.797
Second,

508
17:17.198 --> 17:18.157
you use your channels

509
17:18.797 --> 17:19.797
to promote Jinghua.

510
17:23.718 --> 17:24.278
First term,

511
17:24.958 --> 17:25.637
no.

512
17:26.077 --> 17:26.918
I can use my channels

513
17:26.998 --> 17:27.758
to promote Jinghua.

514
17:27.837 --> 17:28.958
But I want 15 percent

515
17:29.958 --> 17:30.678
of shares.

516
17:33.637 --> 17:34.077
Okay.

517
17:34.678 --> 17:36.518
If you stop selling Jingyue immediately,

518
17:37.357 --> 17:38.278
15 percent is fine.

519
17:39.438 --> 17:42.157
Do you know how profitable Jingyue is?

520
17:45.198 --> 17:47.157
What if I can get you

521
17:48.157 --> 17:49.357
a seat on the board?

522
18:00.238 --> 18:00.678
Deal.

523
18:03.201 --> 18:04.248
Pleasure working with you.

524
18:04.637 --> 18:05.718
Likewise.

525
18:16.278 --> 18:17.758
Bringing Han Guang into this.

526
18:18.357 --> 18:19.038
You really took

527
18:19.958 --> 18:21.278
a risky move.

528
18:22.837 --> 18:23.317
Listen.

529
18:23.837 --> 18:25.998
This is a strategic baiting.

530
18:26.637 --> 18:28.077
Throw meat to two hungry wolves,

531
18:28.198 --> 18:29.958
and they'll tear into each other first.

532
18:30.877 --> 18:32.317
Aren't you afraid they'll team up

533
18:32.518 --> 18:33.157
and bite you?

534
18:35.478 --> 18:36.278
They won't.

535
18:37.157 --> 18:37.678
Look,

536
18:38.797 --> 18:40.077
once Han Guang gets in Jiali,

537
18:40.397 --> 18:41.877
would he still let Di Liren

538
18:42.317 --> 18:43.597
play middleman and take a cut?

539
18:44.198 --> 18:46.317
So to Di Liren right now,

540
18:46.557 --> 18:47.317
Han Guang's threat

541
18:47.317 --> 18:48.157
is bigger than mine.

542
18:48.918 --> 18:50.117
So you're still gambling.

543
18:52.117 --> 18:53.357
Unless you have no dirt on him,

544
18:53.637 --> 18:54.157
otherwise,

545
18:54.478 --> 18:55.633
if he doesn't bite today,

546
18:55.797 --> 18:56.678
he might bite you

547
18:56.758 --> 18:58.198
anytime

548
18:58.357 --> 18:59.077
in the future.

549
19:01.397 --> 19:02.637
I also wish I could

550
19:02.718 --> 19:03.557
enter the battlefield

551
19:03.837 --> 19:05.357
with the absolute certainty.

552
19:07.438 --> 19:09.038
But life doesn't allow me.

553
19:09.557 --> 19:10.831
I can only play it by ear.

554
19:11.758 --> 19:12.877
Once the fight starts,

555
19:13.278 --> 19:13.998
I can't retreat.

556
19:14.357 --> 19:15.678
I have to charge ahead anyway.

557
19:17.797 --> 19:18.797
You are practically

558
19:19.117 --> 19:20.278
paying out of pocket

559
19:20.397 --> 19:21.438
to cover Jiali's losses.

560
19:21.877 --> 19:22.998
If anything goes wrong,

561
19:23.038 --> 19:23.597
no one

562
19:24.438 --> 19:25.494
in Jiali will help you.

563
19:28.518 --> 19:29.918
Honestly, I'm a bit tired.

564
19:30.478 --> 19:31.518
It might help Jiali

565
19:31.837 --> 19:33.157
in the short term,

566
19:34.157 --> 19:35.397
but I can't keep pulling Jiali

567
19:35.918 --> 19:36.758
out of the mud

568
19:36.797 --> 19:37.998
every single time.

569
19:38.678 --> 19:39.718
So this time,

570
19:40.557 --> 19:41.758
rather than keep fighting,

571
19:42.357 --> 19:43.758
I'd rather lost

572
19:43.958 --> 19:44.877
some short-term gains,

573
19:45.238 --> 19:46.198
making them

574
19:46.557 --> 19:47.397
turn on each other.

575
19:48.238 --> 19:49.198
Besides,

576
19:49.637 --> 19:50.758
I'm also trying

577
19:51.117 --> 19:52.278
to find a way out for myself.

578
19:54.357 --> 19:54.958
What way out?

579
19:57.038 --> 19:58.038
You'll see.

580
19:59.758 --> 20:01.198
Jinghua is what matters most now.

581
20:01.758 --> 20:02.998
Once the knockoffs are halted,

582
20:02.998 --> 20:03.478
that's when

583
20:03.518 --> 20:04.518
we make our comeback.

584
20:05.117 --> 20:06.837
Everyone at the company

585
20:07.157 --> 20:08.117
put so many efforts

586
20:08.317 --> 20:09.438
into this product.

587
20:09.678 --> 20:10.397
You know what?

588
20:10.998 --> 20:12.518
Ding got bald patches by hard work.

589
20:13.198 --> 20:13.877
And Mr. Dong

590
20:14.198 --> 20:15.238
got so many more wrinkles.

591
20:16.077 --> 20:17.478
It's time to show those knockoffs

592
20:17.718 --> 20:18.518
once and for all

593
20:18.797 --> 20:20.518
what the genuine products

594
20:20.557 --> 20:21.117
are.

595
20:23.397 --> 20:25.157
Look at you, Queen Yu Meng.

596
20:26.198 --> 20:27.877
What a boss-lady.

597
20:30.397 --> 20:31.718
How does that saying go?

598
20:32.117 --> 20:33.837
If the rules can't hold back the enemy,

599
20:34.117 --> 20:35.397
then we'll flip the whole table.

600
20:35.637 --> 20:37.117
If order can't save the day,

601
20:37.438 --> 20:38.637
then unleash the storm.

602
20:38.958 --> 20:39.718
Only the one

603
20:39.758 --> 20:41.038
standing in the eye of the storm

604
20:41.278 --> 20:42.557
gets to dictate the wind.

605
20:42.837 --> 20:43.198
Look,

606
20:43.998 --> 20:45.640
isn't the night view amidst the storm

607
20:45.958 --> 20:46.877
quite beautiful?

608
20:50.317 --> 20:51.637
Before the storm hits,

609
20:52.438 --> 20:53.837
enjoy this moment of peace.

610
21:09.877 --> 21:10.877
Lady of the Storm,

611
21:11.637 --> 21:13.518
would you like a dance?

612
21:14.038 --> 21:14.518
No way.

613
21:14.918 --> 21:15.597
I can't dance.

614
21:17.317 --> 21:19.317
Come on, move your arms and legs.

615
21:19.678 --> 21:21.278
Slouching your neck

616
21:21.317 --> 21:21.918
and hunching

617
21:22.157 --> 21:23.038
are getting you stiff.

618
21:24.478 --> 21:25.038
You go ahead.

619
21:25.317 --> 21:26.357
You go dance, Mr. Jiao.

620
21:26.478 --> 21:27.357
I really can't dance.

621
21:27.718 --> 21:29.317
You said you had no time for a spa.

622
21:29.758 --> 21:31.117
Here's your free alternative.

623
21:31.877 --> 21:32.278
Come on.

624
21:32.278 --> 21:32.837
I can't dance.

625
21:32.837 --> 21:33.678
You definitely do.

626
21:33.837 --> 21:34.637
Just follow me.

627
21:35.597 --> 21:36.397
You can dance?

628
22:09.317 --> 22:10.038
Thank you.

629
22:13.958 --> 22:14.518
Mr. Tian,

630
22:15.278 --> 22:16.478
I sold my dad's shares.

631
22:17.077 --> 22:18.117
I'll cover Jiali's

632
22:18.478 --> 22:19.038
shortfall.

633
22:21.597 --> 22:23.198
Just like your dad back then,

634
22:23.597 --> 22:24.238
you're bold.

635
22:25.397 --> 22:26.438
But we can't let you

636
22:26.478 --> 22:27.518
take the loss alone.

637
22:28.958 --> 22:29.797
It's not a loss.

638
22:30.597 --> 22:31.877
I plan to use this money

639
22:32.438 --> 22:33.077
to buy Haomeng.

640
22:33.357 --> 22:34.958
H-Haomeng?

641
22:36.877 --> 22:38.357
That's the brand your dad and I made

642
22:38.438 --> 22:39.877
back when we were young.

643
22:40.678 --> 22:41.557
It is worthless.

644
22:41.597 --> 22:42.518
The plant is closed.

645
22:43.077 --> 22:44.518
Even the formula

646
22:44.797 --> 22:46.038
is tucked away in the archives.

647
22:46.557 --> 22:47.478
Why do you want it?

648
22:47.877 --> 22:48.478
I'll show you.

649
22:50.278 --> 22:51.637
A while ago, when I was browsing

650
22:51.837 --> 22:52.837
a thrift market,

651
22:53.238 --> 22:53.877
I saw this.

652
22:54.637 --> 22:55.438
Haomeng Balm.

653
22:56.397 --> 22:57.797
(Haomeng Balm) Someone collected it.

654
22:58.518 --> 22:59.758
This proves that besides us,

655
23:00.238 --> 23:01.357
someone still remembers it.

656
23:03.797 --> 23:04.837
Back then,

657
23:05.157 --> 23:06.397
to get this scent just right,

658
23:06.718 --> 23:08.438
your dad didn't sleep for days on end.

659
23:08.918 --> 23:09.758
This scent filled

660
23:09.918 --> 23:10.837
my entire childhood.

661
23:11.557 --> 23:12.718
I could say I grew up

662
23:12.758 --> 23:14.198
with Haomeng Balm.

663
23:17.597 --> 23:18.157
Mr. Tian,

664
23:18.797 --> 23:19.758
it's not

665
23:20.397 --> 23:21.518
just about business.

666
23:22.238 --> 23:23.518
Haomeng is my dad's life's work,

667
23:24.077 --> 23:25.117
and yours as well.

668
23:26.157 --> 23:26.877
I don't want

669
23:26.918 --> 23:27.758
it to disappear.

670
23:30.117 --> 23:30.758
I'm old now.

671
23:31.557 --> 23:32.518
I don't really get

672
23:32.678 --> 23:33.758
these fancy things.

673
23:35.157 --> 23:35.758
However,

674
23:37.797 --> 23:38.597
if you want

675
23:39.478 --> 23:40.167
its patents,

676
23:40.837 --> 23:42.198
trademarks and formulas,

677
23:43.038 --> 23:43.478
take them.

678
23:44.797 --> 23:45.198
Really?

679
23:47.678 --> 23:48.998
Great! Thank you, Mr. Tian.

680
23:49.357 --> 23:49.958
Don't thank me.

681
23:50.157 --> 23:51.837
You paid for them yourself.

682
23:53.597 --> 23:54.117
(Haomeng Balm) Meng,

683
23:56.038 --> 23:57.238
about what happened earlier,

684
23:58.518 --> 23:59.597
I'm really sorry.

685
24:01.518 --> 24:02.077
I'm

686
24:02.357 --> 24:03.797
willing to provide some cash

687
24:03.998 --> 24:05.357
for Jinghua's marketing.

688
24:05.998 --> 24:06.678
In exchange,

689
24:07.238 --> 24:08.038
I will buy

690
24:08.157 --> 24:09.438
Jiali's discontinued line,

691
24:09.797 --> 24:10.478
Haomeng.

692
24:11.038 --> 24:12.317
Please vote by a show of hands.

693
24:30.918 --> 24:32.077
Besides, I transferred

694
24:32.077 --> 24:33.357
my 15 percent of shares

695
24:33.597 --> 24:34.357
to Mr. Han Guang

696
24:34.438 --> 24:35.518
of Yaoyan

697
