35:03.237 --> 35:03.958
or a new country,

1046
35:04.798 --> 35:05.878
or complete the paperwork

1047
35:06.157 --> 35:07.277
after I get abroad.

1048
35:08.277 --> 35:09.318
You can't stop me.

1049
35:11.838 --> 35:12.838
When did you set up

1050
35:13.038 --> 35:13.798
a trust?

1051
35:16.197 --> 35:17.318
Finally got to the point.

1052
35:18.798 --> 35:20.398
I have to make sure Haoyu

1053
35:20.918 --> 35:22.237
won't be affected by us.

1054
35:23.157 --> 35:24.197
Give me the money,

1055
35:24.318 --> 35:25.478
or he will be affected.

1056
35:28.478 --> 35:29.197
Yu Meng sold

1057
35:29.398 --> 35:31.038
her shares to Han Guang secretly.

1058
35:31.518 --> 35:32.717
I can't wait any longer.

1059
35:33.318 --> 35:34.438
I must get divorced now,

1060
35:35.478 --> 35:36.438
or she'll keep

1061
35:36.717 --> 35:37.318
squandering

1062
35:37.398 --> 35:38.237
her remaining shares.

1063
35:38.438 --> 35:39.998
Then I'll end up with even less!

1064
35:41.478 --> 35:42.717
You're just greedy.

1065
35:43.717 --> 35:44.918
What's it to Haoyu?

1066
35:46.518 --> 35:47.677
Don't you get it?

1067
35:48.438 --> 35:49.677
Once Han Guang joins Jiali,

1068
35:50.038 --> 35:50.717
he will

1069
35:50.757 --> 35:51.518
push me out first!

1070
35:52.398 --> 35:53.478
He wants to get rid of me.

1071
35:54.038 --> 35:55.038
You know what dirt

1072
35:55.157 --> 35:56.237
he has on me.

1073
35:58.518 --> 35:59.277
Talk in the car.

1074
36:05.557 --> 36:06.117
I knew

1075
36:06.157 --> 36:07.398
you wouldn't abandon me.

1076
36:08.318 --> 36:08.998
Even if we aren't

1077
36:09.077 --> 36:09.838
married anymore,

1078
36:10.757 --> 36:11.918
I'm still Haoyu's dad.

1079
36:12.918 --> 36:13.945
What does Han Guang want?

1080
36:16.958 --> 36:18.197
He's using transfer records

1081
36:18.277 --> 36:19.038
to threaten me,

1082
36:19.677 --> 36:20.918
trying to put me in jail.

1083
36:22.918 --> 36:24.358
We have dirt on him too.

1084
36:25.077 --> 36:26.237
The Wengs will protect him.

1085
36:27.038 --> 36:28.438
But we have nothing!

1086
36:29.557 --> 36:31.270
Yu Meng can't wait to put me in jail.

1087
36:34.958 --> 36:35.518
Hui,

1088
36:36.757 --> 36:37.998
you're all I have now.

1089
36:38.958 --> 36:40.918
You have to think about us and Haoyu.

1090
36:41.757 --> 36:42.798
Give me the money.

1091
36:43.197 --> 36:44.237
I divorce Yu Meng

1092
36:44.717 --> 36:45.918
and get the shares,

1093
36:46.197 --> 36:47.038
then I can negotiate

1094
36:47.117 --> 36:48.038
with Han Guang.

1095
36:48.798 --> 36:49.717
Now I have nothing

1096
36:49.757 --> 36:50.878
to keep him in check.

1097
36:52.277 --> 36:52.677
Besides,

1098
36:53.637 --> 36:54.597
you'll be implicated.

1099
36:56.958 --> 36:57.878
Do you want Haoyu

1100
36:58.478 --> 36:59.838
to lose both his dad and mom?

1101
37:01.038 --> 37:02.438
If we both end up in prison,

1102
37:03.597 --> 37:05.478
what kind of life will he have?

1103
37:05.998 --> 37:06.838
I'll figure it out.

1104
37:08.398 --> 37:09.438
Di Liren forged

1105
37:09.478 --> 37:10.557
joint debt?

1106
37:10.998 --> 37:11.998
He's so shameless!

1107
37:13.757 --> 37:14.998
That's how men protect

1108
37:15.077 --> 37:16.038
each other.

1109
37:16.557 --> 37:17.637
Any idiot could see

1110
37:17.757 --> 37:19.157
Han Guang was lying for Di Liren.

1111
37:19.838 --> 37:20.918
As long as there's profit,

1112
37:21.077 --> 37:21.998
Han Guang

1113
37:22.398 --> 37:23.197
can do anything.

1114
37:25.038 --> 37:25.438
Right,

1115
37:26.398 --> 37:27.637
if we go to court,

1116
37:28.117 --> 37:28.838
can I win it?

1117
37:29.478 --> 37:30.157
80 percent.

1118
37:30.557 --> 37:31.438
Unless that IOU

1119
37:31.557 --> 37:32.478
was signed back then.

1120
37:32.637 --> 37:33.438
But I doubt it.

1121
37:34.237 --> 37:35.518
Confirming the debt isn't

1122
37:35.518 --> 37:36.438
what Di Liren wants.

1123
37:36.438 --> 37:37.117
What he wants

1124
37:37.237 --> 37:38.277
is to sow discord between

1125
37:38.318 --> 37:39.136
you and Han Guang,

1126
37:39.157 --> 37:40.215
and use that to force you

1127
37:40.215 --> 37:40.958
to make concessions

1128
37:40.958 --> 37:41.918
in the asset division.

1129
37:41.918 --> 37:43.277
Given Han Guang's nature,

1130
37:43.518 --> 37:44.998
if that IOU were real,

1131
37:45.237 --> 37:46.077
he'd force Di Liren

1132
37:46.117 --> 37:47.518
to cough it up with interest.

1133
37:48.637 --> 37:49.518
Looks like Di Liren

1134
37:49.717 --> 37:50.637
is truly cornered.

1135
37:51.077 --> 37:52.730
Otherwise, he wouldn't turn to Han Guang,

1136
37:53.038 --> 37:54.478
as Han Guang must ask for a return.

1137
37:55.038 --> 37:55.838
But remember,

1138
37:56.438 --> 37:57.438
the more Di Liren loses,

1139
37:57.604 --> 37:59.228
the harder he'll try to recoup from you.

1140
38:01.277 --> 38:02.637
Getting divorced is that risky?

1141
38:03.518 --> 38:04.518
Marriage is like magic.

1142
38:04.878 --> 38:06.717
When you get married, it's like a miracle.

1143
38:06.998 --> 38:08.878
When you get divorced, it's like a minefield.

1144
38:10.557 --> 38:11.077
Marriage is

1145
38:11.117 --> 38:11.839
about two people.

1146
38:11.878 --> 38:12.518
But there's

1147
38:13.038 --> 38:13.958
a person we can use.

1148
38:15.717 --> 38:16.038
Who?

1149
38:16.398 --> 38:17.038
Weng Xin.

1150
38:17.557 --> 38:18.318
Who is Weng Xin?

1151
38:19.518 --> 38:20.958
Weng Xin?

1152
38:21.438 --> 38:22.277
Why her

1153
38:22.557 --> 38:23.478
all of a sudden?

1154
38:25.197 --> 38:26.677
When you pointed her out in the park,

1155
38:26.717 --> 38:27.597
I just found it weird.

1156
38:27.998 --> 38:29.038
So I looked into it

1157
38:29.318 --> 38:30.398
and found out Weng Xin

1158
38:30.478 --> 38:31.438
studied law in college.

1159
38:31.637 --> 38:32.358
After graduation,

1160
38:32.478 --> 38:33.677
she interned at a firm.

1161
38:34.318 --> 38:35.958
Her former colleagues said

1162
38:36.438 --> 38:37.597
she was warm, just,

1163
38:37.677 --> 38:39.157
and full of legal ideals.

1164
38:39.438 --> 38:40.398
But look how she is.

1165
38:41.237 --> 38:41.838
All of it

1166
38:42.237 --> 38:43.918
happened shortly after she got married.

1167
38:46.478 --> 38:47.277
Could it be...

1168
38:49.117 --> 38:50.077
Di Liren smeared me

1169
38:50.157 --> 38:50.878
and claimed

1170
38:51.157 --> 38:51.677
that I had

1171
38:51.717 --> 38:52.717
bipolar disorder.

1172
38:52.998 --> 38:54.237
Did he learn it from Han Guang?

1173
38:57.557 --> 38:58.438
None of these men

1174
38:58.597 --> 38:59.717
are any good.

1175
39:00.277 --> 39:01.518
Whether at Yaoyan,

1176
39:01.597 --> 39:02.237
or Jiali,

1177
39:02.438 --> 39:03.838
Han Guang left no trace.

1178
39:04.117 --> 39:05.398
We can only start from his life.

1179
39:05.958 --> 39:07.557
And I'm certain Weng Xin

1180
39:07.918 --> 39:08.958
is our breakthrough.

1181
39:10.237 --> 39:11.518
If you get dirt on Han Guang,

1182
39:11.717 --> 39:12.318
then he won't

1183
39:12.358 --> 39:13.117
help Di Liren

1184
39:13.197 --> 39:13.798
forge the debt.

1185
39:13.998 --> 39:15.318
But I've only met Weng Xin

1186
39:16.038 --> 39:17.157
once.

1187
39:17.578 --> 39:18.593
Ask Weng Yue out for me.

1188
39:20.518 --> 39:21.438
I need to know

1189
39:21.757 --> 39:22.677
how Weng Xin

1190
39:22.717 --> 39:23.478
and Han Guang met,

1191
39:23.677 --> 39:24.518
when she started

1192
39:24.557 --> 39:25.717
going wrong,

1193
39:26.117 --> 39:27.358
and what illness she has.

1194
39:29.117 --> 39:30.237
Reactive psychosis

1195
39:30.237 --> 39:31.318
is a type of transient

1196
39:31.318 --> 39:32.117
mental disorder.

1197
39:33.237 --> 39:34.157
May I know

1198
39:34.197 --> 39:35.237
how long she's been sick?

1199
39:36.197 --> 39:36.838
For many years.

1200
39:37.038 --> 39:38.098
When was she diagnosed?

1201
39:38.958 --> 39:39.637
Five years ago.

1202
39:40.398 --> 39:40.958
Doctor said

1203
39:40.998 --> 39:42.677
she had suffered from depression for long,

1204
39:42.677 --> 39:43.878
but we never noticed.

1205
39:45.038 --> 39:46.077
From what I know,

1206
39:46.358 --> 39:47.677
after Weng Xin graduated,

1207
39:47.798 --> 39:48.798
she interned at a firm

1208
39:48.838 --> 39:49.637
and did a good job.

1209
39:49.838 --> 39:50.918
She did well after that.

1210
39:50.918 --> 39:52.557
Then she married Han Guang two years later.

1211
39:52.557 --> 39:54.087
Did she get depressed after married?

1212
39:54.157 --> 39:55.398
Has she ever said she didn't

1213
39:55.398 --> 39:55.998
want treatment

1214
39:55.998 --> 39:57.528
or that she wanted to get transferred?

1215
40:00.637 --> 40:01.677
Why are you saying this?

1216
40:04.237 --> 40:05.438
Something similar

1217
40:05.637 --> 40:06.717
happened to my friend.

1218
40:07.197 --> 40:07.878
I am thinking

1219
40:08.318 --> 40:09.358
if your sister's illness

1220
40:09.637 --> 40:10.998
might be linked to her marriage...

1221
40:10.998 --> 40:11.878
It's a family affair.

1222
40:13.277 --> 40:14.398
You shouldn't interfere.

1223
40:15.958 --> 40:16.398
But...

1224
40:28.084 --> 40:30.755
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1225
40:30.998 --> 40:32.318
I have something to ask you.

1226
40:32.438 --> 40:33.637
What do you want to ask?

1227
40:34.478 --> 40:35.597
What exactly did my dad do?

1228
40:36.038 --> 40:36.838
I just remembered

1229
40:37.318 --> 40:38.237
I need to go for a bit.

1230
40:38.318 --> 40:39.478
On my desk are Jiali's

1231
40:39.518 --> 40:40.318
financial statements,

1232
40:40.318 --> 40:41.038
and on my computer

1233
40:41.038 --> 40:42.197
is my analysis.

1234
40:42.478 --> 40:43.277
(Financial Irregularities) Don't touch them.

1235
40:43.518 --> 40:43.918
Dad,

1236
40:44.038 --> 40:45.117
this money isn't yours.

1237
40:45.438 --> 40:46.358
This is a crime!

1238
40:47.358 --> 40:48.358
That's complete nonsense!

1239
40:48.798 --> 40:49.518
I have proof.

1240
40:52.838 --> 40:53.358
This is

1241
40:53.597 --> 40:54.677
what I stole

1242
40:54.677 --> 40:55.318
from Jiao Xu.

1243
40:55.557 --> 40:56.717
Turns out Jiao Xu

1244
40:56.878 --> 40:57.878
was my sister's student.

1245
40:58.157 --> 40:59.398
She was his counselor

1246
40:59.478 --> 41:00.677
and his direct senior.

1247
41:01.157 --> 41:02.237
Tell me about it,

1248
41:02.958 --> 41:03.717
Mr. Jiao.

1249
41:20.527 --> 41:25.396
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1250
41:27.880 --> 41:32.743
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1251
41:35.201 --> 41:40.046
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1252
41:40.491 --> 41:46.993
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1253
41:49.725 --> 41:56.678
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1254
41:57.228 --> 42:03.158
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1255
42:04.282 --> 42:11.513
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1256
42:11.816 --> 42:16.989
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1257
42:17.609 --> 42:29.077
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1258
42:31.577 --> 42:36.825
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1259
42:38.866 --> 42:44.301
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1260
42:46.123 --> 42:51.520
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1261
42:51.520 --> 43:00.165
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

1262
43:00.641 --> 43:08.204
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1263
43:08.204 --> 43:14.050
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

1264
43:14.050 --> 43:24.217
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
